  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p><span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>搜寻者：<br> 1.25× ｜ 1.4× ｜ 1.5× 弹药进度倍率。<br> <br> <span class=\"ammo-heavy\">威能弹药</span>搜寻者：<br> 1.25× ｜ 1.4× ｜ 1.5× 弹药进度倍率。</p>", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/fc4ae31f8f.webp", "kind": "头盔", "name": "弹药搜寻者", "q": "弹药搜寻者"},
