  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>用超能击杀时：<br> 为<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>生成一枚<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>：<br> 2.5% ｜ 3.75% ｜ 4.4% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">两枚能量球之间有 2 秒冷却。</span></p>", "hash": "2982306509 3149307605", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/2830a620e2.webp", "kind": "头盔", "name": "能量节约", "q": "能量节约"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>拾取<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>时：<br> 18 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>获得 <span class=\"armor-charge\">x1 护甲充能</span>。</p>", "hash": "2175577211", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/6aab4887e3.webp", "kind": "头盔", "name": "强力伙伴", "q": "强力伙伴"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>施放超能时：<br> 21 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>获得 <span class=\"armor-charge\">x1 护甲充能</span>。<br> <span class=\"enemy\">施法者</span>本身已有充能时同样获得 <span class=\"armor-charge\">x1 护甲充能</span>。<br> <br> 处在其他分支职业上的<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>改为获得 <span class=\"armor-charge\">x2 护甲充能</span>。</p>", "hash": "2199590568", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/cb9386191c.webp", "kind": "头盔", "name": "辐射光能", "q": "辐射光能"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>3 秒内用与模组元素相同的武器连续击杀 2 名<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<br> 生成一枚<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>：<br> 2.5% ｜ 3.75% ｜ 4.4% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">生成能量球后有 1 秒冷却，冷却期间的击杀不计数。</span></p>", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/e9bc3eb2af.webp", "kind": "头盔", "name": "虹吸", "q": "虹吸"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p><span class=\"armor-charge\">护甲充能</span>生效期间：<br> +20 ｜ +40 ｜ +50 超能属性。</p>", "hash": "1130820873 3461249873", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/7a002a3848.webp", "kind": "头盔", "name": "超能洗礼", "q": "超能洗礼"},
  {"anchor": "sec-1", "desc": "<p>对与模组元素相同的武器，取出 1 秒后：<br> <br> +5 ｜ +8 ｜ +10 瞄准辅助<br> 精度锥体大小 ×0.9 ｜ ×0.85 ｜ ×0.8<br> 开镜时长 ×0.85 ｜ ×0.75 ｜ ×0.7</p>", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/e1c888760c.webp", "kind": "头盔", "name": "瞄准性能", "q": "瞄准性能"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p>造成手雷伤害时：<br> 提供<span class=\"pickup\">职业技能能量</span>。<br> <br> 技能能量获取：<br> 12%<span class=\"pvp\">[6%]</span> ｜ 17%<span class=\"pvp\">[8.5%]</span> ｜ 20%<span class=\"pvp\">[10%]</span><br> <br> <span class=\"note\">触发后有 7 秒冷却。</span></p>", "hash": "3245543337 3726719281", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/5406be54a5.webp", "kind": "护臂", "name": "鼓舞爆弹", "q": "鼓舞爆弹"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p>对与模组元素相同的武器：<br> <br> 取出／收起时长 ×0.8 ｜ ×0.75 ｜ ×0.7。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">收起动画时长不会超过 100 操控性对应的值。</span></p>", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/1ca08d7545.webp", "kind": "护臂", "name": "灵巧", "q": "灵巧"},
  {"anchor": "sec-2", "desc": "<p>手雷的飞行速度与距离提高约 25%。<br> <span class=\"note\">效果强度随手雷种类而变。</span></p>", "hash": "2649291407", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/ef41741195.webp", "kind": "护臂", "name": "快速球", "q": "快速球"},
