  {"anchor": "sec-4", "desc": "<p>拾取<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>时：<br> <br> 5% ｜ 7.5% ｜ 10% <span class=\"pickup\">手雷技能能量</span><br> 5% ｜ 7.5% ｜ 10% <span class=\"pickup\">近战技能能量</span><br> 5% ｜ 7.5% ｜ 10% <span class=\"pickup\">职业技能能量</span></p>", "hash": "2793473444 3184690956", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/b7c73dd956.webp", "kind": "腿部", "name": "宽恕", "q": "宽恕"},
  {"anchor": "sec-4", "desc": "<p>拾取<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>时：<br> 开始<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>回复。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">游戏内说明写着可以叠加，实际不叠加。</span></p>", "hash": "2194294579", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/19f8d7086a.webp", "kind": "腿部", "name": "药到病除", "q": "药到病除"},
  {"anchor": "sec-4", "desc": "<p>拾取元素拾取物或摧毁<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>推进计数。<br> <br> 计数满 100% 时获得 <span class=\"armor-charge\">x1 护甲充能</span>。<br> <br> 元素拾取物的计数进度：<br> <span class=\"el-void\">虚空裂口</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">焰灵</span>与<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>：50% ｜ 50% ｜ 100%<br> <span class=\"el-arc\">离子轨迹</span>：34% ｜ 50% ｜ 50%<br> <span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影碎片</span>：25% ｜ 34% ｜ 50%</p>", "hash": "2996369932 3712696020", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/63b6a1e140.webp", "kind": "腿部", "name": "元素充能", "q": "元素充能"},
  {"anchor": "sec-4", "desc": "<p>+30 ｜ +50 ｜ +60 敏捷。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">PvE 中猎人装 1 个即可把敏捷顶到上限。</span></p>", "hash": "1133590731", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/5756657896.webp", "kind": "腿部", "name": "强化运动", "q": "强化运动"},
  {"anchor": "sec-4", "desc": "<p>收起的武器在一段时间后开始自动填装。<br> <br> 每次触发填装弹匣的 10% ｜ 10% ｜ 15%。<br> 两次触发之间间隔 2.5 ｜ 2 ｜ 2 秒。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">对后膛填装的榴弹发射器、弩与火箭发射器无效。</span></p>", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/cc9c7065bd.webp", "kind": "腿部", "name": "枪套", "q": "枪套"},
  {"anchor": "sec-4", "desc": "<p>拾取<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>时：<br> 10% ｜ 13% ｜ 15% <span class=\"pickup\">手雷技能能量</span>。</p>", "hash": "1750845415", "icon": "armor-mods/icons/b0f9156a90.webp", "kind": "腿部", "name": "支配", "q": "支配"},
